OL,3,GNEWSACall for more food funding due to
OL,4,Ahigh living cost
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Jersey politician said she thought
OL,7,Fcost-of-living pressures were not
OL,8,Fconsidered by the government when it
OL,9,Fchose to end a trial of free fruit in
OL,10,Fprimary schools.
OL,12,FSince 2024 children in four primary
OL,13,Fschools have been able to get apples,
OL,14,Fbananas and other fruit as part of the
OL,15,Fpilot scheme.
OL,17,FDeputy Louise Doublet said: "To have
OL,18,Fthat taken away at a time when the cost
OL,19,Fof living is still increasing I think
OL,20,Fhas been quite hard for some families".
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
