OL,3,GNEWSACall for more food funding due to
OL,4,Ahigh living cost
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe education minister ended the trial
OL,7,Fbecause not enough children were eating
OL,8,Fthe fruit and it was leading to a lot
OL,9,Fof wastage. The Government of Jersey
OL,10,Fhas been approached for a comment.
